        {
            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Thanks for the suggestion!\n\nWell, my recommendation would be to use 'mini.operators' for this :) But I'll take a look if there is a similar simple and robust way to tell that the operator from 'gbprod/substitute.nvim' is in action.\n\nThe reason \"replace\" operator was added (and not immediately after 'mini.operators' release, se #441) is because 'mini.nvim' can guarantee the robust check here. Having to depend on the internal implementation of another plugin is not great.",
