            "author_association": "MEMBER",
            "body": "Ah, I see. No, sorry, I think highlight-on-text-edit-action is a pretty distracting pattern for commonly used actions. Hence both 'mini.operator' and 'mini.surround' (for replace functionality) don't have it. I have even caught myself rethinking the usefulness of highlight-on-yank.",
